4c7351d58ece.avif?t=1778121458\" width=600 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《背包乱斗》中，玩家将使用装满物品的背包进行战斗。取胜的关键在于购买的物品，尤其是物品摆放的位置！摆放搭配越巧妙，越能发挥更强的效果！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/5042cf695f870268871ad5555a44c268.poster.avif?t=1778121458\" width=1170 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/5042cf695f870268871ad5555a44c268.webm?t=1778121458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/5042cf695f870268871ad5555a44c268.mp4?t=1778121458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/77d5125e32c8c1934bbeb2d6343aab73.avif?t=1778121458\" width=600 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >物品形状、大小、稀有度、价格各不相同。互相搭配组合，打造出更强大的装备。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >酿魔药小菜一碟，造神器易如反掌，孵个小龙做朋友，打遍天下无敌手！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >超500种奇妙道具应有尽有！   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/d332d02c532ebaa1f73fc7f56c7f8b70.poster.avif?t=1778121458\" width=1170 height=776 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/d332d02c532ebaa1f73fc7f56c7f8b70.webm?t=1778121458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/d332d02c532ebaa1f73fc7f56c7f8b70.mp4?t=1778121458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_i